> L1 has the byte executed in every recording; the kit keeps it as a byte because StartRace changes the instruction.
$AE64 c BikeLateralPush ; The push: (ScrollStep's high byte, doubled on stages 2 and 4) * the bend's factor ($52, $8F, $A4; BendPrev holds the bend), signed by BendDir; HorizonSpeed too
> Then LateralX += the sideways speed (BounceSpeed added during a bounce) + the push, clamped to $A4-$5C. In the air: JumpHeight += JumpSpeed, JumpSpeed -= $02F0; the landing (below the road's line) ends the jump: pose 3, lean 0, Wheelies 0, and with WHEELIE not held a 6-pass bounce.
